            "id": "coinmarketcal:4728a7237094b:0",
            "title": "Zcash: Coinholders vote on NU7 scope - 25 Aug 2026",
            "description": "<div class=\"body-bgeA9NCs body-pP5gm7BF content-pP5gm7BF\"><div class=\"symbolsContainer-rV5QygYP logosContainer-WbDJg_kR\" data-no-swipe=\"true\"></div><div><span><p class=\"\"><span>Zcash says coinholders will begin voting on the scope of the upcoming NU7 upgrade on August 25, with the vote expected to last approximately 18 days.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>The vote gives holders a direct role in deciding which work is included in the next protocol upgrade. Its relevance comes from the way the outcome can shape Zcash's future technical direction, rather than from an immediate change to the network.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>The announcement establishes a governance process, but it does not by itself confirm which proposals will be selected or how the approved scope will be implemented. Those details remain dependent on the vote's result and subsequent upgrade work.</span></p><div class=\"container-n2KCMK3i\" data-qa-id=\"tweet-widget-container\"><blockquote class=\"blockquote-n2KCMK3i\"><div class=\"header-n2KCMK3i\"><span class=\"profile-n2KCMK3i\"><div class=\"avatar-n2KCMK3i\"></div><div class=\"name-n2KCMK3i\">Sean Bowe</div><div class=\"username-n2KCMK3i\">@ebfull</div></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"logo-n2KCMK3i\" role=\"img\"><svg height=\"28\" viewbox=\"0 0 28 28\" width=\"28\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19.75 5h3.07l-6.7 7.62L24 23h-6.17l-4.84-6.3L7.46 23H4.4l7.17-8.16L4 5h6.33l4.37 5.75L19.75 5Zm-1.24 16h1.7L9.54 7H7.7l10.8 14Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"description-n2KCMK3i\"><p class=\"\"><span>We're coordinating a coinholder vote starting August 25 and lasting approximately 18 days, deciding on the scope of the upcoming NU7 upgrade.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>1,000,000 ZEC (in Ironwood) will be the minimum necessary to accept the results.</span><a class=\"link-zw5jRdec icon-zw5jRdec\" href=\"https://t.co/2emkLte1lr\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/2emkLte1lr</a></p></div><span class=\"date-n2KCMK3i\">Aug 05, 2026</span><span class=\"border-n2KCMK3i\"></span><span class=\"socials-n2KCMK3i\"></span><a href=\"https://x.com/ebfull/status/2085132326493970838\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></blockquote><div></div></div></span></div></div>",
            "link": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/coinmarketcal:4728a7237094b:0-zcash-coinholders-vote-on-nu7-scope-25-aug-2026/",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-08 22:00:14",
