            "id": "coinmarketcal:b79e482d2094b:0",
            "title": "Bittensor: Innerworks technology is tested in five enterprise pilots - 08 Aug 2026",
            "description": "<div class=\"body-bgeA9NCs body-pP5gm7BF content-pP5gm7BF\"><div class=\"symbolsContainer-rV5QygYP logosContainer-WbDJg_kR\" data-no-swipe=\"true\"></div><div><span><p class=\"\"><span>On 08 Aug 2026, Bittensor reported that Innerworks technology is being tested in five new enterprise pilots, according to an OpenTensor post.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>The pilots give the Bittensor ecosystem a concrete enterprise-adoption signal. Testing across additional organizations suggests the subnet's technology is moving beyond isolated experimentation and is being assessed in operational settings. A wider testing footprint can provide evidence that enterprise users are evaluating the technology in practice.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>The update describes testing, not completed production deployment. Availability for pilot evaluation therefore does not establish sustained usage or broader adoption beyond those pilots.</span></p><div class=\"container-n2KCMK3i\" data-qa-id=\"tweet-widget-container\"><blockquote class=\"blockquote-n2KCMK3i\"><div class=\"header-n2KCMK3i\"><span class=\"profile-n2KCMK3i\"><div class=\"avatar-n2KCMK3i\"></div><div class=\"name-n2KCMK3i\">Openτensor Foundaτion</div><div class=\"username-n2KCMK3i\">@opentensor</div></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"logo-n2KCMK3i\" role=\"img\"><svg height=\"28\" viewbox=\"0 0 28 28\" width=\"28\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19.75 5h3.07l-6.7 7.62L24 23h-6.17l-4.84-6.3L7.46 23H4.4l7.17-8.16L4 5h6.33l4.37 5.75L19.75 5Zm-1.24 16h1.7L9.54 7H7.7l10.8 14Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"description-n2KCMK3i\"><p class=\"\"><span>Recently, 5 more enterprise platforms worth $22B+ combined have been testing </span><a class=\"link-zw5jRdec icon-zw5jRdec\" href=\"https://x.com/_redteam_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">@_redteam_</a><span>’s technology. They reach 900M+ accounts and handle 1B+ weekly transactions.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>RedTeam is set to unveil a new immune system built to anticipate cyber threats.</span></p><p class=\"\"><span>Here’s how Bittensor powers it: </span><a class=\"link-zw5jRdec icon-zw5jRdec\" href=\"https://t.co/9xUVIYGFQ4\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/9xUVIYGFQ4</a></p></div><span class=\"date-n2KCMK3i\">Aug 08, 2026</span><span class=\"border-n2KCMK3i\"></span><span class=\"socials-n2KCMK3i\"></span><a href=\"https://x.com/opentensor/status/2086069918546727361\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></blockquote><div></div></div></span></div></div>",
